# Review/support file (not for publication repo)
CODE_REVIEW.md

# Large downloaded data — never commit (the clootl AvesData tree repo is ~1 GB).
# Patterns have no leading slash, so they match at any depth (now under
# Analysis/data/raw/ after the repo reorganisation).
AvesDataLite-main/
terraclimate/
worldclim/

# Generated intermediate files (re-run climate_extraction.R / atlantic_drmsem.R).
# Basename patterns (no leading slash) match wherever the files live —
# Analysis/data/derived/ for the dataset, Analysis/output/ for drmSEM caches,
# archive/ for the superseded un-suffixed caches.
passer90_climate.rds
locality_year_tmean.rds
drmsem_effects_cache*.rds
drmsem_phylo_prep*.rds
drmsem_phylo_results*.rds
drmsem_results_arthro.rds
drmsem_results_noarthro.rds

# Scratch outputs
Rplots.pdf
temperature_diagnostic/

# Large archived BioTIME query cache (exploratory; kept on disk, not in git)
archive/biotime/cache/

# Large generated model objects: these exceed GitHub's 100 MB/file limit
# (e.g. brm0_multiphylo.rda is ~194 MB). Archive them on Zenodo/OSF instead,
# as referenced in the manuscript's Data & code availability section.
brm0_multiphylo.rda
brm_bill_multiphylo.rda
brm_mass_multiphylo.rda
clootl_trees.rds

